# This Angular app does NOT read a .env file at build or runtime — Angular
# has no built-in dotenv support, and this project doesn't add one.
#
# Configuration lives in src/environments/:
#   - environment.ts       (dev build,  apiUrl: http://localhost:8080/api/v1)
#   - environment.prod.ts  (prod build, apiUrl: https://api.crmbento.com/api/v1)
#
# To point the app at a different backend, edit the `apiUrl` in the relevant
# environment file, or override it at build time with a custom
# fileReplacements entry in angular.json.
#
# The backend's own configuration (DB, JWT, CORS, port) is documented in
# ../crm-backend/.env.example.
